  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Climate and Sustainability Policies for Developing Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Brookings Institution will to undertake a series of research and dialogue activities within two work streams, both with a focus on research that supports the development of developing countries: 1) Climate, Nature and Sustainable Development, and 2) Delivering on the Sustainable Development Goals. Brookings will inform key stakeholders and decision-makers through rigorous, independent analysis of the issues and provide practical recommendations for meeting global development policy challenges and the promotion of peaceful and inclusive societies</narrative>
  </description>
